 "discovery_notes": "Follow-up 10 of B005 (packets 205-590). 28 standard searches, snippets only. New pins: passiondlp Q2 2019 surprise singles Fête des Mères (26/05, LE 700), Fête des Pères (16/06, LE 700), Saison Été (June, LE 700); dein-dlrp Dec 2019 BatB open-edition trio of 7 Dec (Madame Garderobe, Enchanted Rose, Lumière & Von Unruh). New set without members: Toy Story 4 surprise trio (26/06, LE 500, Barrel of Monkeys). Corroboration: 13 Jul 2019 Pin Trading Day (500 each) = Jungle Day date. Hold added: Princesses Day Moana (passiondlp says cancelled). Surprise UP set (9 Jun LE 425) was already in packet 205/552; no change."
